Hi everyone,

This summer I ran a test study to see if snorkeling fish counts could produce population estimates for a side channel.  I broke the side channel into habitat units (24) and resampled the site four times.  I used covariates for habitat type, snorkel pass, time of snorkel, average depth, length, and area.  I did not include the covariate data to save space.

I have pasted my age-0 fish count data below.

